arr.add(8);
arr.toArray(); // [2, 5, 8]
arr.indexOf(5); // 1
arr.remove(5); // true
arr.toArray(); // [2, 8]
```

**Edge cases:**

- Empty array operations
- Single element
- Duplicate values
- Negative numbers
- String comparisons with custom locale
- Large datasets (100+ elements)

